@startuml
autonumber

actor Operator
participant "Platform API" as API
participant "Drone" as Drone
participant "Projection Processor" as Processor

Operator -> API: Create and plan mission
API --> Operator: Planned mission

Drone -> API: Poll for eligible missions
API --> Drone: Mission details
Drone -> API: Claim mission (idempotency key)
API --> Drone: Dispatch accepted
API --> Operator: Dispatched state

Drone -> API: Report started
API --> Operator: Running state
Drone -> API: Report completed
API --> Operator: Completed execution

Drone -> API: Upload manifest/data
API --> Drone: Upload acknowledgement
Drone -> API: Finalize upload
API --> Operator: Result ready for validation

Operator -> API: Accept/reject measurements
API --> Operator: Draft result revision
Operator -> API: Finalize result revision
API --> Operator: Finalized revision
API -> Processor: Recalculate projection asynchronously
Processor --> API: New projection version
API --> Operator: Projection freshness updated
@enduml
